  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Garden Dairy Products Processing Social Enterprise in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Garden dairy is women owned and managed enterprise engaged in dairy processing business. The enterprise collects milk from farmers via their coop and process into d/t dairy products. Garden dairy is intended to address market problem for dairy farmers. It also addresses low milk productivity and dairy products quality problems through capacity building of dairy farmers on dairy cow feeding management and quality maintenance.  The project proposed to increase its collection and processing capacity into 10,000 lit &amp; create market access for 2000 farmers by 2028. The company current annual revenue is 325,412 GBP &amp; will be increased to 5,270,600 GBP by the end of 2028.</narrative>
  </description>
